message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Strange loop in J-space: what a language model builds when a description of itself is looped back into itself"
authors:
  - family-names: Tomasik
    given-names: Wiktor
date-released: 2026-10-12
version: "1.0"
url: "https://github.com/Pixedar/jspace-strange-loop"
